ht, and I listened: this update is all about making the library easier to read at a glance. Thank you so much for your feedback. 💜🏷️ Every shelf has its own stampEach shelf now carries its own stamp: the shape of its section, the colour of its culture, and a symbol.The stamps are on both sides of the case, so you can read them from the atrium and from the corridor.Each cas","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T22:41:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114038199","verified_at":"2026-10-24T02:52:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5075360-1846651706696409","game_id":"steam-5075360","kind":"announcement","title":"Live now: tidying up the Library of Alexandria!","summary":"The Library of Alexandria never sleeps! 🐱📜The free demo is being played live, round after round: armfuls of scrolls carried back to their shelves, the toy each cat is guarding found at last, and every ability put to work, from the Apple of Knowledge to the charged jump. Each round starts a fresh library, with the scrolls scattered in new places.Want to tidy it yourself? The demo is free, and you can play it solo or with friends in online co-op and split screen.Thank you for stopping by, and for ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T18:45:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706696409","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:39:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5075360-1846651706696055","game_id":"steam-5075360","kind":"announcement","title":"Tidy up TOGETHER: Online Co-op & Split Screen!","summary":"Next Fest is here, and so is our biggest news yet: Tidy up the Library of Alexandria has online co-op and split screen! 📜📜\\🤝 Tidy up togetherInvite a friend online, or share the couch in split screen.Every scroll you shelve counts for both of you.The cats are shared too: find a toy together, and the scroll they guard is yours.Try it in the demo now! Press MULTIPLAYER in the main menu.\\🏛️ Out on Thursday 5 November The full game comes out on 5 November on Windows, macOS and SteamOS. Add it to you","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T17:02:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706696055","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:39:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5075360-1846651706688042","game_id":"steam-5075360","kind":"update","title":"Demo update 1.0.19: Legendary abilities & animated scrolls","summary":"Hello, tidy librarians! 📜 Next Fest starts tomorrow, so we gave the library one last dusting. Thank you all for playing the demo and sharing your thoughts, they shape every update. 💛✨ Legendary abilitiesThe things you eat now have proper names: Shell of Hermes (sprint), Phoenix Egg (charged jump), Mirror of Pharos (teleport) and Apple of Knowledge (sonar).Every ability you find adds a hand-drawn card to the Tutorial page, with its logo, its name and a short tip.The tips show the key you actually","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T21:14:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706688042","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:39:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5075360-1846651706679426","game_id":"steam-5075360","kind":"update","title":"Demo update 1.0.17: “Everything is in place” fixed, a new cat toy","summary":"Hi everyone! 💜🏆 Achievement fixed“Everything is in place” now unlocks when you place the 192nd scroll and finish the demo.Already finished the demo before? Just open the game and it unlocks for you.Thank you to the player who reported it in the Community hub!🐱 For the catsA new toy: a wooden sword, so every cat now has its own toy.Toys no longer float frozen in the air; they settle on the floor.📜 Loading a gameCats no longer keep scrolls that were already on the shelves.Scrolls never end up stuc","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T22:08:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706679426","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:39:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5075360-1846018067945046","game_id":"steam-5075360","kind":"update","title":"Demo update 1.0.13: rebind every key, examine your scrolls, full hands... and +!","summary":"🖥️ A smoother first launchSome of you saw a black or half-sized screen the first time you opened the demo (it could happen with 4K TVs, super-resolution settings or some multi-monitor setups). The demo now starts in borderless mode, and if you were stuck in fullscreen it moves you to borderless once (you can still pick Fullscreen in Settings, and it will stay).🎮 Rebind every keyA new KEY BINDINGS page in Settings › Controls. Change every action for keyboard, mouse (side buttons too!) and gamepad","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T18:38:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067945046","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:39:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5075360-1846018067941108","game_id":"steam-5075360","kind":"update","title":"Demo update, shaped by your feedback! 1.0.8","summary":"Thank you so much for playing the demo, and for every review and comment. They shaped this update. Here’s what changed:Start from the very beginning. The demo is now the whole library from scratch: no half-sorted floors, no red barriers, no “OUT OF DEMO” signs. Every floor, every door and every cat is open to you, and the demo ends once you’ve placed 192 scrolls.Every cat can be reached, so the demo can always be finished.A gentler first minute. You start in the atrium with scrolls in hand, and ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T14:20:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067941108","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:39:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5075360":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:04Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:03Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5075360":"2026-10-26T08:00:04Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5075360":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:03Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:03Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:03Z"},"5313670":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:04Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:04Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:04Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5075360","app_id":5075360,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:23Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"105999fa2167d58fa3fca65cf8d0a395a1d1f07f7bb2ff510c893ea7842bde2f","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Cozy first-person organizing game. Sort 4,800 scrolls of 21 real ancient alphabets back onto the shelves of the Library of Alexandria, where every cat wants a toy: find it to get the scroll it guards! Play solo, or tidy up together in online co-op and split screen!","publishers":[{"name":"Javideas","creator_clan_account_id":46111280}],"develop